title: "Population-Weighted Proximity to Mapped Public Transit in Addis Ababa"
type: software
abstract: "Reproducible code and derived outputs for a population-weighted, Euclidean-proximity analysis of gridded population (WorldPop) relative to OpenStreetMap-mapped public-transit access points in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia."
